## Astro page rules
- Every page: export const prerender = true (static by default)
- Every content page MUST have: title, description, canonical
- IPO pages: include JSON-LD structured data (FinancialProduct)
- Broker pages: noindex if affiliate_url is null
- GMP data: show source_count and last_updated — never raw avg
- Use ipo_status_view — never compute status in component